  "observations": [
    "Opened all seven complete main-edge sheets and all20 internal-seam sheets from final decoded v7. No dominant straight rectangular chunk border observed in these offline views.",
    "Inspected six game-scale v3|v7 comparisons. Native paintings add stronger stone/metal/crystal facets and rail detail. Inherited texture and silhouette equivalence is not certified.",
    "River ripple shapes/line spacing and cloud texture differ between independently drawn natives. The seam blend can hide a straight cut without making every ripple or stone grout line semantically continuous.",
    "r1-c5 sky detail does not show a dominant straight cut in the inspected crop; stair-top still measures5px displacement with both the standard final method and the inherited low-pass method.",
    "Final standard structure report retains19 confident probes over4px (max10.4403) and59 uncertain. A separate original-method retest in r4-c2 retains a6.4031px rock match. These are unresolved diagnostics, not proof of a semantic contour error at every sample.",
    "No v3 fallback or ImageGen repair was applied. Final unavoidably extrapolated native samples occupy8229 output pixels at outer map edges only; max band thickness5 output pixels. No uncovered-domain component in the interior.",
    "No in-game loader/memory/performance or walking/collision test was run. Whole semantic structure tolerance and seam invisibility in actual game remain unresolved."
  ],
